 creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 5; favorites: 5; remixes: 2.\nTags: dashboard, security, input, validation, animated, webgl, threejs, dither.\n## Overview\nAurasell Accelerate Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nAurasell Platform Solutions Resources Login Next-Gen Revenue Interface Unleash Global Revenue Velocity Empower your operations with AI-driven pipeline analytics. Forecast with precision, scale across borders, and domina…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Unleash Global Revenue Velocity.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #050505, secondary #0A0A0A, accent #050505, background #050505, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Geist for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aurasell - Accelerate Revenue</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\">\n    <style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-geist\">.font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif !important; }</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-[#050505] text-white selection:bg-white/20\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; margin: 0; overflow-x: hidden;\">\n\n    <!-- Monotone Background Ambient Glow -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-30\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[-10%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[40rem] h-[40rem] bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-[120px]\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Container Lines Wrapper -->\n    <div class=\"w-full max-w-[1200px] mx-auto relative z-10 flex flex-col min-h-screen border-x border-white/10 px-4 md:px-8 lg:px-12 pt-6 md:pt-8 pb-12\">\n\n        <!-- Corner Squares -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#050505] hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 -right-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#050505] hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#050505] hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -right-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#050505] hidden md:block\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Header / Nav -->\n        <header class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-8 md:mb-12 w-full\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <!-- Brand Icon -->\n                <div class=\"inline-flex gap-[2px] items-end h-[24px] text-white/80\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block w-[2px] bg-current rounded-full\" style=\"height: 12px;\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block w-[2px] bg-current rounded-full\" style=\"height: 18px;\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block w-[2px] bg-current rounded-full\" style=\"height: 24px;\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block w-[2px] bg-current rounded-full\" style=\"height: 18px;\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block w-[2px] bg-current rounded-full\" style=\"height: 12px;\"></span>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-white/90 font-geist\">Aurasell</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex gap-10 text-xs font-light text-white/50\" aria-label=\"Main Navigation\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Platform</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Solutions</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Resources</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Border Gradient Skill -->\n            <button class=\"relative rounded-full p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-transparent hover:from-white/40 transition-colors group\" aria-label=\"Start Free Trial\">\n                <div class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-[#0a0a0a] flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:bg-[#111] transition-colors\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-white/90 font-geist\">Login</span>\n                </div>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Main Content Remixed Centered Layout -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col w-full relative\">\n\n            <!-- Centered Hero Card -->\n            <div class=\"w-full rounded-[2rem] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/15 via-white/5 to-transparent shadow-2xl transition-transform duration-700 hover:-translate-y-1 relative z-10 flex-grow flex flex-col\">\n\n                <div class=\"rounded-[calc(2rem-1px)] overflow-hidden relative flex flex-col items-center bg-[#0a0a0a] w-full border border-white/5 flex-grow\">\n\n                    <!-- Dither Overlay for monotone texture -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-[1]\" style=\"opacity: 0.15; mix-blend-mode: overlay; background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=\\'0 0 200 200\\' xmlns=\\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\'%3E%3Cfilter id=\\'noiseFilter\\'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=\\'fractalNoise\\' baseFrequency=\\'0.85\\' numOctaves=\\'3\\' stitchTiles=\\'stitch\\'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=\\'100%25\\' height=\\'100%25\\' filter=\\'url(%23noiseFilter)\\'/%3E%3C/svg%3E');\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Top Content Area -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-20 flex flex-col items-center text-center w-full px-4 sm:px-8 pt-16 md:pt-24 lg:pt-32 max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n\n                        <!-- Eyebrow -->\n                        <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 mb-6 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-fall-linear\" class=\"text-white/70 text-xs\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70 font-geist tracking-wide\">Next-Gen Revenue Interface</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Masked Reveal Heading -->\n                        <h1 id=\"reveal-title\" class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-white font-geist font-light\">\n                            Unleash Global Revenue Velocity\n                        </h1>\n\n                        <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-white/50 font-light max-w-2xl mt-6 leading-relaxed font-geist\">\n                            Empower your operations with AI-driven pipeline analytics. Forecast with precision, scale across borders, and dominate your market from one unified command center.\n                        </p>\n\n                        <!-- Call to Actions -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 mt-10\">\n                            <!-- Primary CTA with Border Gradient -->\n                            <button class=\"relative rounded-full p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/30 to-transparent hover:from-white/50 transition-colors group\">\n                                <div class=\"px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white text-black flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-sm font-medium font-geist\">Deploy Platform</span>\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-black text-sm transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                            </button>\n                            <!-- Secondary CTA -->\n                            <button class=\"px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors text-sm font-light font-geist flex items-center gap-2 group\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" class=\"text-lg transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                Watch Overview\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Social Proof -->\n                        <div class=\"mt-16 md:mt-20 flex flex-col items-center gap-5 w-full\">\n                            <p class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/30 font-geist tracking-widest uppercase\">Trusted by industry leaders</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 md:gap-16 items-center text-white/20\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:leaf-bold-duotone\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon><span class=\"font-geist text-sm tracking-tight font-medium\">Vertex</span></div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-bold-duotone\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon><span class=\"font-geist text-sm tracking-tight font-medium\">Aegis</span></div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:crown-bold-duotone\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon><span class=\"font-geist text-sm tracking-tight font-medium\">Imperium</span></div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 hidden sm:flex\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:waterdrops-bold-duotone\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon><span class=\"font-geist text-sm tracking-tight font-medium\">Lumina</span></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- WebGL Container for Globe (Centered Bottom) -->\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full h-[350px] md:h-[450px] lg:h-[550px] mt-auto overflow-hidden pointer-events-none z-10 flex-shrink-0\">\n                        <div id=\"globe-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Gradients to blend globe into monotone theme -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-32 md:h-48 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0a0a0a] to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-24 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0a0a0a] to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-24 bg-gradient-to-l from-[#0a0a0a] to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Interactive Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            // Masked Reveal Animation via GSAP\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const title = document.getElementById('reveal-title');\n            if (title) {\n                const text = title.innerText;\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n                title.innerHTML = '';\n\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                    wrapper.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n                    wrapper.style.marginRight = '0.25em';\n                    wrapper.style.lineHeight = '1.05';\n                    wrapper.style.paddingBottom = '0.1em'; // Prevent clipping of descenders\n\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.innerText = word;\n                    inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    inner.style.transform = 'translateY(110%)';\n                    inner.className = 'reveal-word';\n\n                    wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                    title.appendChild(wrapper);\n                });\n\n                gsap.to('.reveal-word', {\n                    y: '0%',\n                    duration: 1.2,\n                    ease: 'power4.out',\n                    stagger: 0.08,\n                    delay: 0.1,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: title,\n                        start: 'top 90%'\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n\n            // Init Three.js Globe - Centered Monotone Configuration\n            const container = document.getElementById('globe-container');\n            if (!container) return;\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40, container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n\n            const isDesktop = window.innerWidth >= 1024;\n            camera.position.z = isDesktop ? 2.2 : 2.6;\n            camera.position.y = 0;\n            camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            const globeGroup = new THREE.Group();\n\n            // Position globe centered and slightly lowered for bottom focus\n            globeGroup.position.x = 0;\n            globeGroup.position.y = isDesktop ? -0.5 : -0.3;\n            scene.add(globeGroup);\n\n            // Base Sphere - Dark Monotone\n            const sphereGeometry = new THREE.SphereGeometry(1, 64, 64);\n            const sphereMaterial = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0x111111,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.98\n            });\n            const sphere = new THREE.Mesh(sphereGeometry, sphereMaterial);\n            globeGroup.add(sphere);\n\n            // Particle Surface\n            const particlesGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const particlesCount = 12000;\n            const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n            const colorsArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i+=3) {\n                const phi = Math.acos(-1 + (2 * i) / (particlesCount * 3));\n                const theta = Math.sqrt(particlesCount * 3 * Math.PI) * phi;\n                const r = 1.01;\n\n                let finalR = r;\n                const isNetworkArea = (phi > Math.PI/5 && phi < Math.PI/1.5) && (theta % (Math.PI*2) > 0 && theta % (Math.PI*2) < Math.PI * 1.5);\n\n                if (isNetworkArea) {\n                    finalR += Math.random() * 0.04;\n                }\n\n                posArray[i] = finalR * Math.cos(theta) * Math.sin(phi);\n                posArray[i+1] = finalR * Math.sin(theta) * Math.sin(phi);\n                posArray[i+2] = finalR * Math.cos(phi);\n\n                // Monotone grayscale intensity\n                const baseIntensity = isNetworkArea ? 0.9 : 0.2 + Math.random() * 0.3;\n                colorsArray[i] = baseIntensity;\n                colorsArray[i+1] = baseIntensity;\n                colorsArray[i+2] = baseIntensity;\n            }\n\n            particlesGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n            particlesGeometry.setAttribute('color', new THREE.BufferAttribute(colorsArray, 3));\n\n            const particlesMaterial = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.005,\n                vertexColors: true,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.6,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(particlesGeometry, particlesMaterial);\n            globeGroup.add(particlesMesh);\n\n            // Flight Paths / Connections - Subtle Monotone\n            const linesMaterial = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0xffffff,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.15\n            });\n\n            for(let i=0; i<30; i++) {\n                const startLat = (Math.random() * Math.PI/1.5);\n                const startLon = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n                const endLat = (Math.random() * Math.PI/1.5);\n                const endLon = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n\n                const startPoint = new THREE.Vector3(\n                    1.02 * Math.cos(startLon) * Math.sin(startLat),\n                    1.02 * Math.sin(startLon) * Math.sin(startLat),\n                    1.02 * Math.cos(startLat)\n                );\n\n                const endPoint = new THREE.Vector3(\n                    1.02 * Math.cos(endLon) * Math.sin(endLat),\n                    1.02 * Math.sin(endLon) * Math.sin(endLat),\n                    1.02 * Math.cos(endLat)\n                );\n\n                const midPoint = startPoint.clone().lerp(endPoint, 0.5).normalize().multiplyScalar(1.15 + Math.random() * 0.2);\n                const curve = new THREE.QuadraticBezierCurve3(startPoint, midPoint, endPoint);\n\n                const curvePoints = curve.getPoints(50);\n                const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(curvePoints);\n                const line = new THREE.Line(geometry, linesMaterial);\n                globeGroup.add(line);\n            }\n\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                globeGroup.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.03;\n                globeGroup.rotation.z = Math.sin(elapsedTime * 0.05) * 0.02;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n            animate();\n\n            // Responsive Handling\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                if (!container) return;\n                const width = container.clientWidth;\n                const height = container.clientHeight;\n                renderer.setSize(width, height);\n                camera.aspect = width / height;\n\n                const desktop = window.innerWidth >= 1024;\n                camera.position.z = desktop ? 2.2 : 2.6;\n                globeGroup.position.x = 0;\n                globeGroup.position.y = desktop ? -0.5 : -0.3;\n\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aurasell-accelerate-revenue-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/aurasell-accelerate-revenue-1.jpg", "source_name": "aurasell-accelerate-revenue-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 74, "forks": 7, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T07:26:05.128009+00:00"}